<title>USA: 3CI Complete seeks waiver on covenant.</title>
<headline>3CI Complete seeks waiver on covenant.</headline>
<dateline>SHREVEPORT, La 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>3CI Complete Compliance Corp said Monday it had started talks to get a waiver for a financial loan covenant for the remainder of the fiscal year, which ends September 30.</p>
<p>The company said it would not be in compliance with its covenant for the fiscal year.</p>
<p>It said it wanted to raise its line of credit after a drop in cash from its operations.</p>
<p>The company said it had sought and obtained a waiver for the quarter ended June 30.</p>
